Sends a torrent of searing darkness through your foes, doing [171, 231, 277, 316, 350 (TL1-5; MP 100)] darkness damage. There is a 25% chance the rushing darkness will blind them for 3 turns and cause them to lose track of their target.

If you know the Creeping Darkness talent, a short-lived trail of darkness is left in the beam's wake. Its damage is identical to that of Creeping Darkness's.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower. You do [+5%, +9%, +12%, +15%, +17% (TL1-5)] damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.
